@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
participant WorkflowEngine as W
participant "Actor / Reviewer" as A
participant MCPGateway as G
participant "MCP Server" as S
participant DocumentStore as D
G -> S : initialize(protocolVersion="2025-06-18")
S --> G : version, capabilities, serverInfo
G -> S : notifications/initialized
G -> S : tools/list
S --> G : tools + inputSchema
W -> A : actor(...) / reviewer(...)
A -> G : call(name, arguments)
G -> S : tools/call
S -> D : call(name, arguments)
D --> S : evidence + optional image data
S --> G : TextContent + ImageContent
G --> A : dict(evidence, images)
A --> W : Answer / Review completion event
note over W : EventBus dispatches completion;
state/evidence guards control next step
@enduml
